      "tree_id": "f0b057f6b8dfafe99231478f6bc360a8b4b208e7",
      "message": "Critical-line zeros: Comparator 7892797, the last Comparator commit on Lean v4.33.0-rc2\n\nMaintainer run 41964266185 (2026-11-05) failed in setup: Comparator\n57567492 does not build with v4.33.0-rc2 (Main.lean:221, no\nLean.Kernel.Environment.replay). Its own toolchain is v4.34.0-rc1, and\nLake also replaced our lean4export 9fb131bb with b18d673b, the pin of its\nmanifest. Anthropic's CI built that Comparator with its own toolchain; our\nsetup builds Comparator and lean4export with the toolchain of the profile.\n\nComparator 789279735fe44c1c05dc54bb9f46ba4d9b8c7611 is the merge of #65\n(fix #64, the reason for the old pin). It is the last Comparator commit on\nv4.33.0-rc2, and its manifest pins lean4export 9fb131bb, our pin. The later\ncommits add multi-kernel support (#75) and fix #67 (Comparator fails, not\npasses) and #71 (only for a target named Quot.mk, Quot.lift or Quot.ind).\nIssue #68 is fixed in Lean core (leanprover/lean4#14728), not in\nv4.33.0-rc2; it does not apply to this challenge (no structure declared;\nevery structure comes from the pinned Mathlib build). setup() does not\nchange.\n\nCo-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>",
      "timestamp": "2026-11-05T04:15:33Z",
